<title>USA: Global Intellicom Inc Q4 net, share down.</title>
<headline>Global Intellicom Inc Q4 net, share down.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q4			  Year</p>
<p>			 1996	  1995	 1996	  1995</p>
<p> Revenue	 $18,221,687 $9,487,025 $42,205,002 $30,477,467</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)  82,255    191,966  (1,085,388)    270,183</p>
<p>Net Income (Loss)</p>
<p>  per Share	     0.01	 0.06	(0.33)	  0.09</p>
<p>Weighted Average</p>
<p>Number of Common</p>
<p>  Shares	   4,600,182  3,134,400   3,527,053   2,927,170</p>
<p>NOTE: In Q3 1996, Global Intellicom acquired Global-InSync Inc, a manufacturer of servers, workstations and PCs, and Speech Solutions Inc, a provider of high-end voice technology to the development community and the Internet.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
